300
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:30,800
You're right.

301
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:32,240
Salt makes it greener.

302
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:32,920
Right?

303
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:35,040
Baking soda cleans out

304
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:37,520
