308
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,960
Cut it.

309
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,400
Otherwise,

310
00:13:49,800 --> 00:13:50,640
even if blanched,

311
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,480
