A million percent Wang Churan.

575
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,200
It's definitely Shen Teng.

576
00:27:01,440 --> 00:27:02,600
Once the music stops, he goes quiet.

577
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,920
What? I'm all the way at the edge!

578
00:27:06,280 --> 00:27:06,840
I hear something.

579
00:27:07,520 --> 00:27:08,160
There's a sound!

580
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:09,520
There's a sound right here.

581
00:27:09,520 --> 00:27:10,840
That's the sound of the waves.

582
00:27:10,840 --> 00:27:11,880
No, there really is a sound here.

583
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:14,160
Could it be me?

584
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:15,040
Is it?

585
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:17,040
Was that Johnny Huang just now?

586
00:27:17,280 --> 00:27:18,320
Where's Johnny?

587
00:27:18,320 --> 00:27:19,280
I'm right here.

588
00:27:19,560 --> 00:27:20,800
How... how did you end up over here?

589
00:27:21,280 --> 00:27:22,160
Where else would I be?

590
00:27:23,320 --> 00:27:23,800
You...

591
00:27:23,800 --> 00:27:25,000
Keep talking, Johnny.

592
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,640
Why do you sound so out of breath?

593
00:27:27,720 --> 00:27:29,160
I think his voice is moving.

594
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:30,440
Then it's definitely him!

595
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:32,920
Johnny, if you stay quiet, it's you!

596
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:34,800
What can you even do with him?

597
00:27:35,960 --> 00:27:36,440
He's...

598
00:27:37,320 --> 00:27:38,320
Tighten the circle!

599
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:40,400
Group up near Shen Teng!

600
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:40,720
Come on.

601
00:27:41,440 --> 00:27:42,880
Everyone come to me, over here!

602
00:27:48,560 --> 00:27:49,160
Right here!

603
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:49,640
I hear a noise.

604
00:27:50,040 --> 00:27:50,840
Hey!

605
00:27:52,200 --> 00:27:52,520
Hey!

606
00:27:53,240 --> 00:27:54,280
Bing, I'm kind of scared.

607
00:27:54,520 --> 00:27:55,400
Scared of what? Walk this way!

608
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:56,960
Save me!

609
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:00,920
Wait, hold on.

610
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:02,800
Grab him!

611
00:28:03,280 --> 00:28:04,000
Did you catch him?

612
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:04,240
I...

613
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:05,760
Did you catch him?

614
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:08,000
Grab him!

615
00:28:08,760 --> 00:28:09,680
Did you get him?

616
00:28:10,400 --> 00:28:10,840
Oh, no.

617
00:28:11,440 --> 00:28:12,320
Bing, hurry back! Bing!

618
00:28:12,320 --> 00:28:13,120
I'm back.

619
00:28:15,800 --> 00:28:16,440
There's a sound!

620
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:18,840
Churan, head...

621
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:21,120
Churan, come this way, Churan!

622
00:28:21,120 --> 00:28:21,760
Churan, come over here! Come on!

623
00:28:21,760 --> 00:28:22,280
Which way? Which way?

624
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:23,600
Where do I go?

625
00:28:23,600 --> 00:28:24,600
Over here!

626
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:25,160
Straight ahead!

627
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:28,160
To your front left!

628
00:28:29,400 --> 00:28:30,200
Follow the clapping!

629
00:28:31,320 --> 00:28:31,640
Come on!

630
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,280
Clap for Churan, come on!

631
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:42,720
Say something, Churan, it's fine.

632
00:28:44,320 --> 00:28:45,040
Okay!

633
00:28:48,520 --> 00:28:49,000
Bring it on!

634
00:28:49,480 --> 00:28:50,320
Come on, Johnny Huang!

635
00:28:50,640 --> 00:28:51,640
Bring it on, Johnny Huang, come on!

636
00:28:54,560 --> 00:28:55,040
I hear a sound!

637
00:28:55,560 --> 00:28:56,000
Wait.

638
00:28:56,600 --> 00:28:57,200
Sand is kicking up!

639
00:28:57,880 --> 00:28:58,600
No, that might be me.

640
00:28:58,600 --> 00:28:59,800
Over here, he's right here!

641
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:04,800
He's coming this way!

642
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:05,760
We're done for!

643
00:29:06,520 --> 00:29:07,400
Xiao Hu is "down"!

644
00:29:31,360 --> 00:29:32,280
Don't touch her! Don't touch her!

645
00:29:33,960 --> 00:29:34,400
Who?

646
00:29:36,760 --> 00:29:37,360
Johnny Huang!

647
00:29:37,680 --> 00:29:39,080
Me?

648
00:29:43,560 --> 00:29:44,720
Wait, I bumped his face!

649
00:29:45,040 --> 00:29:45,840
That counts as a loss!

650
00:29:45,840 --> 00:29:47,280
I bumped your face, Johnny Huang!

651
00:29:51,880 --> 00:29:52,440
Over here!

652
00:29:52,440 --> 00:29:53,840
30 seconds left!

653
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:03,960
Only Churan's left!

654
00:30:16,280 --> 00:30:16,760
Nice!

655
00:30:17,720 --> 00:30:18,840
That's enough, Churan.

656
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,040
Impressive!

657
00:30:24,280 --> 00:30:24,760
Not bad.

658
00:30:25,640 --> 00:30:26,360
Awesome.

659
00:30:27,320 --> 00:30:28,640
Johnny was a real gentleman too.

660
00:30:29,560 --> 00:30:31,240
Those giant flippers totally whacked me!

661
00:30:33,120 --> 00:30:35,560
Okay, The Stomper didn't win this round.

662
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:38,040
That step-back of yours was pretty slick.

663
00:30:38,040 --> 00:30:39,240
He kept moving like that the whole time.

664
00:30:40,080 --> 00:30:40,720
Oh, right.

665
00:30:42,640 --> 00:30:44,040
Chengcheng just lifted the balloon like that.

666
00:30:51,880 --> 00:30:52,800
I don't get it.

667
00:30:52,800 --> 00:30:54,320
Just switch your hand direction.

668
00:30:54,320 --> 00:30:55,480
Make your hand movements bigger.

669
00:30:55,480 --> 00:30:56,280
Okay.

670
00:31:03,720 --> 00:31:06,000
The challenge officially begins!

671
00:31:22,320 --> 00:31:23,720
This is...

672
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:24,800
I forgot to make my move.

673
00:31:27,480 --> 00:31:28,000
Again.

674
00:31:28,360 --> 00:31:29,440
Your turn.

675
00:31:56,160 --> 00:31:57,160
Oh no.

676
00:31:57,160 --> 00:31:58,400
I styled my hair for nothing.

677
00:31:59,400 --> 00:31:59,960
Down you go!

678
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,840
Watch the edges!

679
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:08,480
Will his pants come off when he gets up?

680
00:32:09,960 --> 00:32:11,640
Bing's pants are chasing behind him!

681
00:32:43,400 --> 00:32:44,120
Here we go.

682
00:32:55,280 --> 00:32:56,520
We should've knocked it down to him.

683
00:32:58,040 --> 00:32:59,400
Why is it always me?

684
00:33:06,680 --> 00:33:08,080
I barely survived a few rounds.

685
00:33:08,520 --> 00:33:09,400
Sunglasses ready.

686
00:33:20,000 --> 00:33:21,640
I bet they just want to jump in.

687
00:33:28,320 --> 00:33:29,000
I've got this.

688
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:55,200
The MVP
